  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecumenical Climate Ambassadors for COP30</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bring together faith leaders (men, women, young people, indigenous leaders) from Protestant and Catholic Groups in Latin America to strengthen national and regional level faith voices for climate justice. There is a plan of activities for faith leaders in 2025 - of which the first is a conference to bring faith leaders together, strategise, build confidence and technical knowledge and develop position papers and an advocacy plan. This is being done together with Caritas Internationalis, World Council of Churches, Anglican Alliance, Lutheran World Fellowship, ACT Alliance.</narrative>
  </description>
